# Data outputs — keep curated parquets + sample, exclude per-run raw artifacts.
# Rationale: 1,280-run raw CSVs (~17 MB) + Pulse logs (~50 MB) belong on Zenodo,
# not in git history. Per-run config.json + run_meta.json are also excluded —
# every config is reproducible from `morris_sample.parquet` + `src/scenario.py`.
